      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANCONA (4) is yet to miss the placings here in an excellent record which boasts three wins and four placings. Was out of placings last time (17.23) at Healesville in a Rank Limit - Grade 5, finishing seventh and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks well placed and should feature. BUB WHO (5) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (23.24) at Geelong in a Grade 5. Well placed here and can atone this time. SUPREME QUEEN (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (23.50) in a Grade 5 at this track. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to run well. WHY NOT ZACH (1) placed last start and is in the mix again.",
